      "role": "user",
      "content": "I need help writing a formal letter to my Hausverwaltung (property management) here in Berlin. My radiator in the living room stopped working yesterday and it's getting really cold. I need to formally request a repair and make sure they know I expect this to be handled urgently. Can you draft a professional letter for me?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a draft for your formal letter to the Hausverwaltung. I've kept the tone professional, but I've also made sure to emphasize the urgency of the situation. You can send this via email or registered mail.\n\n***\n\n**Subject: Urgent Repair Request – Broken Radiator in Apartment [Your Apartment Number]**\n\nDear [Hausverwaltung Name or Specific Contact Person],\n\nI am writing to formally report a maintenance issue in my apartment, [Your Apartment Number], located at [Your Street Address]. My living room radiator stopped functioning completely yesterday, [Date], and the cold temperatures are becoming quite uncomfortable.\n\nGiven the current weather conditions, I must request that this repair be treated with the highest urgency. Please arrange for a qualified technician to inspect and repair the radiator as soon as possible. I would appreciate it if you could confirm receipt of this request and provide an estimated timeframe for when the repair will be carried out.\n\nThank you for your prompt attention to this critical matter.\n\nSincerely,\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Phone Number]\n\n***\n\nThis letter is clear, direct, and formal, which is exactly what you need when dealing with property management. It clearly states the problem, the location, and the",
